WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.350
The low starter converts through Rush.

2
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.350
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle sends Ken airborne.

3
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.350
Jumping medium punch continues the juggle.

4
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:04.950
The delayed short-held airborne light special connects.

5
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.900
Luke lands and finishes with light Rising Uppercut.
